title: 纳粹陷入危机
subtitle: 纳粹党的内部矛盾终于让它自食其果。
view-if: year = 1933 and month >= 9 and nsdap_r >= 8 and (nsdap_normalized + dnvp_normalized + (unemployed/150)) < 0.5 and chancellor_party != "NSDAP"
